      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The analgetic activity of dipidolor and diazepam as well as absence of such an effect in pipolfen were established in experiments on 200 albino rats of both sexes. The combined action of the drugs is manifested in the form of potentiated sinergism shown by increased potency and duration of analgesia."},
